~ start
match PlayerStats.curr_level
	when "start"
		if not PlayerStats.in_photo
			Max: Three colors are ominously placed in the corner.
			Max: Yellow, blue, and red...
			Max: Why do these colors feel so stupid?
		else
			Max: Still the same ol' bookshelf.
			Max: Come to think of it I haven't touched its contents in a very long time.
	when "messy_house"
		if not PlayerStats.in_photo
			Max: Great. All my books are on the floor.
			Max: ...
			Max: EVEN MY LIMITED EDITION MATSUNE HIKU CD???
			Max: Bart, if you weren't so cute you'd be a dead man right now.
		else
			Max: The books are neatly organized again. 
			Max: Perfectly balanced, as all things should be.
=> END